Other notable interactions:
* {{I|Compost}}: Isaac will gain twice as many flies per use, meaning each fly will be tripled.
* {{tf|Beelzebub}}: Blue flies generated will be doubled, but charmed flies will not be doubled.
* {{I|Rotten Baby}}: Will spit two flies at a time with one being a copy. Will only spawn more flies when the original fly is destroyed.
* {{I|Parasitoid}}: The duplicated flies will spawn on top of the enemy and deal damage immediately.
* {{c|Tainted ???}} / {{i|IBS}}: Blue flies created by corny poops will be duplicated when spawned in, but not when the poop is broken.
* {{c|Keeper}} / {{c|Tainted Keeper}}: Blue Flies created from hearts will be doubled.
* {{a|Golden Trinket}} / {{i|Mom's Box}}: If you have either, when blue files are spawned, 20% chance to triple the number spawned.
** {{dlc|r+}} If you have both, 20% chance to quadruple the number spawned.

